        "description": "Any audio source in, two conditioned bags out. levels: every channel enveloped, ranked to 0..1 over a sliding window and settled — read level, the bands and centroid here. hits: every channel as a 1 ms attack / decaying release pulse — read kickCount, snareCount, hatCount, onsetCount and beatCount here; through levels a count rests at its mid-rank, not at 0.",
